{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>中國貿促會今日（15日）表示，APEC工商領導人峰會將於11月17日至18日（周二至周三）在深圳前海國際會議中心舉行，國家主席習近平、香港、澳洲、加拿大、智利、印尼、韓國、馬來西亞、墨西哥、俄羅斯、泰國、越南APEC經濟體領導人將出席峰會並發表演講、致辭或參與專題研討。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:15:57.895059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:53:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:03:34.359466+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:31.706618+00:00","content_hash":"7f69626c0f21da9e03d40b5e7f9f8bd1cca17247ee99076ec198821c2240f286","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}